  "title": "Southern Italian Thanksgiving Stuffing",
  "description": "This Southern Italian Thanksgiving stuffing recipe includes Italian sausage, pancetta, sage, French bread, cornbread, pine nuts, Parmesan, and mozzarella.",
  "authors": [
    "Briana"
  ],
