  "ingredients": [
    "1.5 pounds bulk Italian sausage",
    "6 ounces pancetta bacon, diced",
    "2 tablespoons olive oil",
    "7 large stalks celery, chopped",
    "2 onions, chopped",
    "4 cloves garlic, minced",
    "6 cups day-old French bread, cut into 1/2 inch cubes",
    "3 cups crumbled cornbread",
    "1 cup toasted pine nuts",
    "1.5 tablespoons rubbed dried sage",
    "1.5 tablespoons poultry seasoning",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "4 cups chicken broth",
    "2 cups shredded mozzarella cheese",
    "0.5 cup butter",
    "2 tablespoons chopped fresh sage",
    "1 ounce shaved Parmesan cheese"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C). Grease a deep 9x13-inch baking dish or roasting pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Se4VJ9Coy8Bp3g_qT3Nr8NlC194=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-180977-southern-italian-thanksgiving-stuffing-step-01-4x3-792a06b212c84a9d9023cd0dc62c1755.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/180977/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat a large skillet over medium-high heat, Add sausage; cook and stir until crumbly, evenly browned, and no longer pink. Drain and discard any excess grease.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/5dXsRMTcbcE27Uc-DQC41GGbgzU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-180977-southern-italian-thanksgiving-stuffing-step-02-4x3-c83a3a3003d946c38d933f6171517692.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/180977/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer sausage to a large bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/N3NRPsprdVzaQKpNtqgi7m3KaWY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-180977-southern-italian-thanksgiving-stuffing-step-03-4x3-d31cba3caf72477ebb33f739d0688a54.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/180977/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, heat pancetta and olive oil in the same skillet over medium heat until it begins to brown. Stir in celery and onions; cook until onions soften and turn translucent, about 8 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/1xNa1L9BeM6pQUBjH7bf2BEKvi4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-180977-southern-italian-thanksgiving-stuffing-step-04-1-4x3-b8161207c0fb42a58b55ad8d467bf326.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/180977/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in garlic; cook until aroma mellows, about 3 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/mPAmYPgX1TJRTuIVm4HzFnJWMok=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-180977-southern-italian-thanksgiving-stuffing-step-05-4x3-211d72ac4c714b92aea5ad562fa2c8fc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/180977/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer onion mixture to the bowl with sausage.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/THkoV1cQYS-FWVi4ns3IoRkScrg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-180977-southern-italian-thanksgiving-stuffing-step-06-4x3-e865fa567c6a4b17b179897b481c974e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/180977/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add French bread, cornbread, pine nuts, rubbed sage, poultry seasoning, and salt; stir to combine. Add chicken broth and mozzarella cheese; stir until bread absorbs broth and stuffing is combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/UjPljlb-_ldmVH_g-2pNiJDpyLg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-180977-southern-italian-thanksgiving-stuffing-step-07-4x3-992eb43b7b6a4e5aa51b25d53f3019e6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/180977/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer stuffing to the prepared baking dish; pack in. Dot butter over top. Cover dish with aluminum foil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/6Fjy7VTHYVqF0BXYycgcIh6mGYQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-180977-southern-italian-thanksgiving-stuffing-step-04-4x3-a8fc7b7720c14f58916eaba4be294506.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/180977/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven for 45 minutes; uncover dish and continue baking until top turns golden brown, about 15 minutes more. Sprinkle with fresh sage and shaved Parmesan cheese; serve.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/BNKePP_Xquu7_r3C2-ks1YRl9_c=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-180977-southern-italian-thanksgiving-stuffing-step-09-4x3-f8420a07b7bc49ffbef667531b7d29e7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/180977/step_09.webp"
    }
  ],
